    "content": "<h2>What Are Non-Voice Jobs?</h2>\n<p>Non‑voice jobs involve handling customer queries, data entry, or back‑office processes through <strong>email, chat, or backend tools</strong> – without making or receiving phone calls. They are ideal for freshers who prefer written communication and want to avoid the pressure of a call centre environment.</p>\n\n<h3>Top Non-Voice Job Profiles in Mumbai</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>Email Support Executive</li>\n  <li>Chat Process Associate</li>\n  <li>Data Entry Operator</li>\n  <li>Back Office Executive</li>\n  <li>Content Moderation Analyst</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Which Companies Hire for Non-Voice Roles?</h3>\n<p>Major BPOs and IT firms like Tech Mahindra, Wipro, Accenture, and local Mumbai startups frequently hire non‑voice freshers. The average salary ranges from ₹15,000 to ₹25,000 per month for entry‑level roles. Find the latest openings on our <a href=\"https://www.employeetable.in/jobs-in-mumbai\">Mumbai jobs page</a>.</p>\n\n<h3>How to Apply for Non-Voice Jobs on Employee Table</h3>\n<p>We’ve made it super easy: just search for “Non Voice” on the homepage or click on any listing. You’ll see an <strong>Apply Now</strong> button, a <strong>WhatsApp chat</strong> link to speak directly with HR, and sometimes a <strong>direct call</strong> option. No middlemen, no registration fees.</p>\n\n<p>Start your career today – explore <a href=\"https://www.employeetable.in/?keyword=Non+Voice&location=Mumbai\">non‑voice jobs in Mumbai</a> and apply in one click.</p>",
