    "slug": "top-it-companies-hiring-freshers-2026",
    "excerpt": "TCS, Infosys, Wipro, Accenture & 6 more are hiring thousands of freshers in 2026.\nGet salary packages, eligibility criteria, and direct apply links — all verified free.",
    "content": "<article class=\"blog-post-body\">\n\n  <!-- INTRO -->\n  <p class=\"lead-para\" style=\"font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#374151;margin-bottom:1.5rem;\">\n    If you graduated in <strong>2024 or 2025 batch</strong> and are still searching for your first job — \n    this is the most important article you'll read this year. India's IT sector is in full hiring mode in 2026.\n    <strong>TCS alone plans to hire 42,000 freshers. Infosys is targeting 20,000.</strong> The window is open — \n    but it moves fast. Here's every top company, their exact salary packages, eligibility rules, and where to apply.\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#EFF6FF;border-left:4px solid #2563EB;padding:1rem 1.25rem;border-radius:0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;margin-bottom:2rem;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.9rem;color:#1E40AF;\">\n      <strong>✅ Employee Table Verified:</strong> All companies and salary figures in this article \n      are sourced from official career pages and verified hiring announcements as of May 2026. \n      <a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#1D4ED8;text-decoration:underline;\">Browse verified job listings →</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS -->\n  <div style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#111827;margin:0 0 0.75rem;\">📋 Quick Jump</h2>\n    <ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;color:#2563EB;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:2;\">\n      <li><a href=\"#tcs\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">TCS — 42,000 fresher openings</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#infosys\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">Infosys — ₹6.25 to ₹21 LPA</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#wipro\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">Wipro — Turbo & WILP tracks</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#accenture\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">Accenture — ASE & packaged app roles</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#cognizant\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">Cognizant — GenC programme</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#hcl\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">HCLTech — 4× pay for elite track</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#capgemini\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">Capgemini — ISEP & IGET</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tech-mahindra\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">Tech Mahindra — Smart Academy</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#ltimindtree\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">LTIMindtree — NxtGen hiring</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#ibm\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">IBM — Entry-level AI & Cloud roles</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#how-to-apply\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">How to apply & pro tips</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#salary-table\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">Salary comparison table</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── 1. TCS ── -->\n  <section id=\"tcs\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      1. 🏆 TCS (Tata Consultancy Services) — India's Biggest Fresher Recruiter\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹3.36 – ₹11 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Pan India</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Actively Hiring</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      TCS is India's single largest employer of fresh graduates, and 2026 is no exception. \n      The company plans to hire approximately <strong>42,000 freshers</strong> this financial year — making it \n      one of the biggest off-campus drives in Indian corporate history.\n    </p>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1F2937;margin:1rem 0 0.5rem;\">TCS Hiring Tracks &amp; Salaries</h3>\n    <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background:#2563EB;color:white;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;text-align:left;border-radius:0.25rem 0 0 0;\">Track</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;text-align:left;\">Salary (LPA)</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;text-align:left;border-radius:0 0.25rem 0 0;\">Focus Area</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"background:#F9FAFB;\">\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">Ninja (Standard)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">₹3.36 LPA</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">General IT services</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">Digital</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">₹7 LPA</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">Cloud, AI, Analytics</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"background:#F9FAFB;\">\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\">Prime</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\">₹11 LPA</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\">Advanced coding, system design</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      <strong>How to apply for TCS fresher jobs:</strong> Register on the \n      <strong>TCS iON National Qualifier Test (NQT)</strong> — this is the gateway exam for all TCS tracks. \n      Score high in NQT → get shortlisted for your matching track automatically.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <strong>Eligibility:</strong> BE/BTech/ME/MTech/MCA/BSc IT — 60% throughout with no active backlogs. \n      Gap in academics should not exceed 2 years.\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"background:#EFF6FF;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:0.5rem;margin:1rem 0;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.875rem;color:#1E40AF;\">\n        🔍 <strong>Employee Table Tip:</strong> TCS NQT scores are valid for 1 year. \n        Even if you miss one drive, your score carries over to the next batch recruitment.\n        <a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#1D4ED8;text-decoration:underline;\">Find TCS fresher openings on Employee Table →</a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 2. INFOSYS ── -->\n  <section id=\"infosys\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      2. 💼 Infosys — Highest Fresher Salary Jump in 2026 (Up to ₹21 LPA)\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹6.25 – ₹21 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Bangalore, Pune, Chennai, Hyderabad, Mysuru</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Off-campus drive open</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      Infosys made headlines in 2026 by significantly raising entry-level pay for specialised roles — \n      packages now go up to <strong>₹21 LPA for Specialist Programmer L3</strong>, a massive jump from previous years. \n      The company is hiring <strong>20,000 freshers</strong> for FY2026 and has already onboarded 12,000 in H1.\n    </p>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1F2937;margin:1rem 0 0.5rem;\">Infosys 2026 Fresher Roles &amp; Packages</h3>\n    <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background:#2563EB;color:white;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;text-align:left;\">Role</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;text-align:left;\">Salary (LPA)</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;text-align:left;\">Bonus</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"background:#F9FAFB;\">\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">Digital Specialist Engineer (DSE)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">₹6.25 LPA</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">₹75,000 joining bonus</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">Specialist Programmer L1</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">₹10 LPA</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">₹1 lakh joining bonus</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"background:#F9FAFB;\">\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">Specialist Programmer L2</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">₹16 LPA</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\">Specialist Programmer L3</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\">₹21 LPA</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.8rem;\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <strong>Selection process:</strong> Online test (aptitude + coding) → Technical interview → HR interview. \n      Infosys also runs <strong>HackWithInfy</strong> and <strong>InfyTQ</strong> coding challenges — \n      performing well here fast-tracks you to SP/DSE roles.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 3. WIPRO ── -->\n  <section id=\"wipro\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      3. 🚀 Wipro — 10,000–12,000 Freshers Targeted in 2026\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹3.5 – ₹6.5 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Bangalore, Hyderabad, Pune, Chennai, Delhi</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Hiring</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      Wipro is targeting <strong>10,000–12,000 freshers</strong> in 2026, focusing on cloud, cybersecurity, and digital transformation roles. The company runs specialized tracks — <strong>Turbo and WILP (Wipro Integrated Learning Program)</strong> — where top coding performers earn up to ₹6.5 LPA.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <strong>How to get in:</strong> Apply via Wipro's official careers page → clear the NLTH (National Level Test for Hiring) or WILP exam → technical + HR rounds. Strong performers in the coding section are automatically considered for the Turbo track.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 4. ACCENTURE ── -->\n  <section id=\"accenture\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      4. 🌐 Accenture — ASE &amp; Packaged App Roles for Any Graduate\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹4.5 – ₹8 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Bangalore, Mumbai, Hyderabad, Pune, Delhi</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Regular drives</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      Accenture is one of the most inclusive fresher employers — they hire from <strong>any graduation stream</strong> (not just CS/IT) for their Associate Software Engineer (ASE) roles. The selection test covers cognitive ability, technical MCQs, and a communication round — no heavy coding required for the standard track.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      <strong>Pro tip:</strong> Accenture frequently runs <strong>off-campus drives via AMCAT</strong>. Register on AMCAT, give the Accenture test, and you'll be directly shortlisted if you score above the cutoff — no campus required.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 5. COGNIZANT ── -->\n  <section id=\"cognizant\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      5. 🏢 Cognizant — GenC Programme: Hire, Train, Deploy\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹4 – ₹6.5 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Chennai, Hyderabad, Pune, Bangalore, Kolkata</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Ongoing</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      Cognizant's <strong>GenC (Generation Cognizant)</strong> programme is purpose-built for freshers. After being selected, you go through an intensive training program before being deployed to a live project — making it one of the best companies if you want proper on-the-job training, not just a job. The GenC Next track (for higher scorers) starts at ₹5–6.5 LPA.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 6. HCL ── -->\n  <section id=\"hcl\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      6. ⚡ HCLTech — Up to 4× Higher Pay for Elite Fresher Track\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹3.8 – ₹14+ LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Noida, Chennai, Bangalore, Hyderabad</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Hiring</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      HCLTech made a bold move in 2026 — they revised their elite fresher hiring strategy to offer <strong>up to 4× higher pay</strong> for a select cadre of top-performing graduates. If you have a strong GitHub profile, competitive coding experience, or AI/ML project work, aim for their elite track. The standard track starts at ₹3.8 LPA but the premium band can go well above ₹10 LPA.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 7. CAPGEMINI ── -->\n  <section id=\"capgemini\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      7. 🇫🇷 Capgemini — ISEP &amp; IGET Tracks for Freshers\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹3.8 – ₹7.5 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Mumbai, Pune, Bangalore, Hyderabad</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Regular off-campus</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      Capgemini runs two fresher tracks: <strong>ISEP</strong> (Immediate Selection for Engineering Program — standard, ₹3.8 LPA) and <strong>IGET</strong> (Infra &amp; Cloud — higher package for DevOps/Cloud candidates). The selection test includes GameBased Assessment (GBA) + technical + HR rounds. Their hiring is consistent throughout the year with quarterly off-campus drives.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 8. TECH MAHINDRA ── -->\n  <section id=\"tech-mahindra\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      8. 📱 Tech Mahindra — Smart Academy &amp; Fresher Bulk Hiring\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹3.25 – ₹5.5 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Pune, Hyderabad, Chennai, Noida</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Hiring</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      Tech Mahindra offers the <strong>Smart Academy for Digital Technologies</strong> — a unique program where selected freshers get 3–6 months of paid training and are then absorbed into live projects. This is ideal if you want to transition from a non-IT background into tech. They also hire through walk-in drives which are frequently updated on Employee Table.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 9. LTIMindtree ── -->\n  <section id=\"ltimindtree\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      9. 🔷 LTIMindtree — NxtGen Programme for 2025 Batch\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹5 – ₹8 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Bangalore, Pune, Mumbai, Chennai</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Off-campus open</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      LTIMindtree (formed from the merger of L&amp;T Infotech and Mindtree) offers one of the <strong>best fresher packages in the mid-size IT segment</strong>. Their <strong>NxtGen</strong> fresher hiring programme targets engineering graduates with strong fundamentals. Selection includes a coding assessment on HackerRank + 2 rounds of technical interviews. A CGPA of 7.0+ is preferred.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── 10. IBM ── -->\n  <section id=\"ibm\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      10. 🤖 IBM — Entry-Level AI, Cloud &amp; Consulting Roles in India 2026\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background:#F0FDF4;border:1px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n      <span>💰 <strong>Salary:</strong> ₹5.5 – ₹12 LPA</span>\n      <span>🎓 <strong>Batch:</strong> 2024 &amp; 2025</span>\n      <span>📍 <strong>Cities:</strong> Bangalore, Hyderabad, Noida, Pune</span>\n      <span>⏰ <strong>Status:</strong> Open roles</span>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:#374151;line-height:1.8;\">\n      IBM India is actively hiring freshers for <strong>AI, Cloud, and Consulting</strong> roles in 2026. Their entry-level \"Application Developer\" and \"Associate System Engineer\" roles offer strong learning paths with IBM's internal certification programs. IBM also runs the <strong>IBM SkillsBuild</strong> program — completing it gives you a certified edge during their hiring process.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── SALARY COMPARISON TABLE ── -->\n  <section id=\"salary-table\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-b