-campus</td><td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\">NxtGen</td></tr>\n          <tr><td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;\">10</td><td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;font-weight:600;\">IBM</td><td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;\">₹5.5 LPA</td><td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;color:#15803D;font-weight:600;\">₹12 LPA</td><td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;\">Open roles</td><td style=\"padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;\">SkillsBuild</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── HOW TO APPLY ── -->\n  <section id=\"how-to-apply\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:2.5rem 0 0.75rem;border-bottom:2px solid #DBEAFE;padding-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n      🎯 How to Apply for Fresher IT Jobs in 2026 — Step-by-Step\n    </h2>\n\n    <div style=\"display:grid;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;\">\n      <div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;\">\n        <span style=\"background:#2563EB;color:white;border-radius:50%;width:2rem;height:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">1</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 0.3rem;\">Fix your resume first</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">Use an ATS-friendly single-column format. Include a GitHub link, internships, and at least 2 projects with measurable outcomes. 80% of rejections happen here — at the resume screening stage.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;\">\n        <span style=\"background:#2563EB;color:white;border-radius:50%;width:2rem;height:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">2</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 0.3rem;\">Register on TCS iON &amp; AMCAT immediately</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">These two assessments are the gateway to TCS (NQT) and Accenture/Capgemini (AMCAT). Your score is valid for 1 year and used by multiple companies.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;\">\n        <span style=\"background:#2563EB;color:white;border-radius:50%;width:2rem;height:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">3</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 0.3rem;\">Apply to 5–10 companies simultaneously</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">Don't wait for one to respond before applying to others. Fresher hiring cycles move in batches — apply in bulk to maximize your chances.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;\">\n        <span style=\"background:#2563EB;color:white;border-radius:50%;width:2rem;height:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">4</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 0.3rem;\">Set up job alerts on Employee Table</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">We manually verify every listing before it goes live. <a href=\"/#job-alerts\" style=\"color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline;\">Subscribe to free job alerts</a> — new off-campus drives are posted every day and slots fill up within hours.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.75rem;padding:1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;\">\n        <span style=\"background:#2563EB;color:white;border-radius:50%;width:2rem;height:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;\">5</span>\n        <div>\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 0.3rem;\">Practice 30 minutes of DSA every day</h3>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">Every company on this list tests basic Data Structures &amp; Algorithms in their coding rounds. LeetCode easy + medium questions for arrays, strings, and recursion — that's all you need for the service company track.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ── FINAL CTA ── -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1E40AF,#3B82F6);border-radius:1rem;padding:2rem;text-align:center;margin:2.5rem 0 1.5rem;color:white;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 0.75rem;color:white;\">Don't Miss the Next Off-Campus Drive</h2>\n    <p style=\"color:#BFDBFE;margin:0 0 1.25rem;font-size:0.95rem;\">\n      Employee Table posts new verified fresher job openings from TCS, Infosys, Wipro and 500+ other companies — every single day. Free. No spam.\n    </p>\n    <a href=\"/#job-alerts\" style=\"background:white;color:#1E40AF;font-weight:700;padding:0.75rem 2rem;border-radius:0.5rem;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;font-size:0.95rem;\">\n      🔔 Get Free Job Alerts Now\n    </a>\n    <p style=\"color:#93C5FD;font-size:0.8rem;margin:0.75rem 0 0;\">No fees. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── FAQ for schema ── -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:2.5rem;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:0 0 1rem;\">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    <details style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n      <summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#1F2937;\">Which IT company has the highest fresher salary in India in 2026?</summary>\n      <p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">Infosys offers the highest fresher salary in 2026 — up to ₹21 LPA for the Specialist Programmer L3 role. Among mass recruiters, Infosys's SP track now leads the market.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n      <summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#1F2937;\">Can I apply to TCS and Infosys at the same time?</summary>\n      <p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">Yes, absolutely. There is no rule preventing you from applying to multiple IT companies simultaneously. In fact, applying to 5–10 companies at once is strongly recommended for freshers.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">\n      <summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#1F2937;\">What is the minimum percentage required for IT fresher jobs in 2026?</summary>\n      <p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">Most major IT companies (TCS, Infosys, Wipro, Cognizant) require a minimum of 60% aggregate throughout academics (10th, 12th, and graduation) with no active backlogs.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details style=\"background:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1rem;\">\n      <summary style=\"font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#1F2937;\">How do I find verified fresher off-campus drives in 2026?</summary>\n      <p style=\"margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:#4B5563;font-size:0.9rem;\">Employee Table manually verifies all fresher job listings before publishing. You can browse daily updates at <a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline;\">employeetable.in</a> or subscribe to free email alerts to get notified the moment a new drive opens.</p>\n    <